Template: rackpanel/username
Type: string
Default: admin
Description: RackPanel username:
 You sign in to the web UI with this name (lowercase letters, digits, . _ -).

Template: rackpanel/password
Type: password
Description: RackPanel password:
 At least 5 characters. Leave it empty to set it later with
 "rackpanel -set-user NAME".

Template: rackpanel/port
Type: string
Default: 80
Description: Web UI port:
 80 means you simply open http://NAME-OF-THE-DEVICE in a browser.
